#title  Shiganshina Morning
#song   0x05
#tempo  92
#reverb 40
; G major. A: flute over harp, soft strings and pizzicato (I-V6-vi-IV / I-IV-V-I).
; B: the oboe turns to E minor (vi-IV-I-V / vi-IV-ii-V). A': flute again with a
; violin counter-line. 24 bars, loops.

#define HG o3 g o4 d g b o5 d o4 b g d
#define HD o3 f+ o4 d f+ a o5 d o4 a f+ d
